  "patch_change": {
    "source_ref_id": "source:riot-patch-notes:26.16",
    "status": "listed",
    "text_en": "Kennen With the reshape to Hextech Rocketbelt to prevent it from becoming the ubiquitous mage legendary, Kennen came out behind the pack. We are buffing him to compensate, making sure he is rewarded well when he does find the right flanks for those huge team-deleting ults. R - Slicing Maelstrom Bonus Resistances : 20 / 40 / 60 ⇒ 25 / 50 / 75 Damage : 40 / 75 / 110 (+22.5% AP) ⇒ 40 / 80 / 120 (+25% AP) Maximum Damage : 300 / 562.5 / 825 (+168.75% AP) ⇒ 300 / 600 / 900 (+187.5% AP)"
  },
